%% -------------------------------------------------------------------------
%% DIAGRAM 1: HIGH-LEVEL ARCHITECTURE (TWO-PRODUCT JOURNAL PIPELINE)
%% -------------------------------------------------------------------------
```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph MobileProduct ["Mobile Application (Patient & Caregiver)"]
        MobileLogUI["Vital Entry Form <br/> (Glucose, BP, Weight, HbA1c)"]
        OfflineQueue["Offline Observation Queue <br/> (AsyncStorage with UUID Idempotency Keys)"]
        TrendVisualizer["Longitudinal Trend Visualizer <br/> (Time-in-Range, Glycemic Variability)"]
        SyncManager["Bi-directional Sync Engine <br/> (Automatic replay upon network restoration)"]
    end

    subgraph DoctorWebProduct ["Doctor Web Application (Clinician Only)"]
        DoctorTimeline["Patient Clinical Timeline <br/> (Aggregated Vitals & Scribe Consult Notes)"]
        AmbulatoryProfile["Ambulatory Glycemic Profile (AGP) <br/> (Mean Glucose, GMI, CV%, Time in Range)"]
        DoctorEntry["Clinician In-Clinic Reading Entry <br/> (Provenance: DOCTOR_CLINICAL)"]
    end

    subgraph APIBackend ["Shared API Backend (Unified Health Journal Engine)"]
        ObservationRouter["/api/observations <br/> (GET, POST, PATCH with audit history)"]
        UnitConverter["Medical Unit Conversion Engine <br/> (mg/dL <-> mmol/L, kg <-> lbs, % <-> mmol/mol)"]
        SafetyGate["P0.0.1 Clinical Safety Evaluator <br/> (ADA 2026 / ACC AHA 2017 Thresholds)"]
        AuditPipeline["Medical Audit & PHI Redactor <br/> (Immutable access & mutation trails)"]
    end

    subgraph DatabaseLayer ["Unified Persistence Layer (SQLite / Prisma)"]
        DB_Obs[("HealthObservation <br/> +clinicalFlag, secondaryValue, idempotencyKey, sourceProvenance")]
        DB_Audit[("AuditLog <br/> +before/after correction diffs")]
        DB_Profile[("PatientProfile <br/> +clinician glycemic & BP targets")]
    end

    MobileLogUI --> OfflineQueue
    OfflineQueue --> SyncManager
    SyncManager --> ObservationRouter
    MobileLogUI --> TrendVisualizer

    DoctorTimeline --> ObservationRouter
    DoctorEntry --> ObservationRouter
    DoctorTimeline --> AmbulatoryProfile

    ObservationRouter --> UnitConverter
    ObservationRouter --> SafetyGate
    SafetyGate --> DB_Obs
    ObservationRouter --> AuditPipeline
    AuditPipeline --> DB_Audit
    ObservationRouter --> DB_Profile
```

%% -------------------------------------------------------------------------
%% DIAGRAM 2: OBSERVATION INTAKE AND OFFLINE SYNCHRONIZATION PIPELINE
%% -------------------------------------------------------------------------
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Patient / Caregiver
    participant Mobile as Mobile App (Offline Queue)
    participant Sync as Background Sync Service
    participant Route as API Gateway (/api/observations)
    participant Evaluator as Clinical Safety Evaluator
    participant DB as HealthObservation Store

    User->>Mobile: Record Blood Glucose (115 mg/dL, Fasting)
    Note over Mobile: Generates client UUID idempotencyKey.<br/>Stores locally in offline queue if offline.

    alt Device is Offline
        Mobile-->>User: Observation Queued Locally (Pending Sync)
        Note over Sync: Network connectivity restored
        Sync->>Route: POST /api/observations (replays queued items with idempotencyKey)
    else Device is Online
        Mobile->>Route: POST /api/observations (immediate submission)
    end

    Route->>DB: Check idempotencyKey uniqueness
    opt Key already processed
        DB-->>Route: Existing Observation Record
        Route-->>Mobile: 200 OK (isIdempotentReplay: true)
    end

    Route->>Evaluator: evaluateClinicalSafety(type, value, context, profileTargets)
    Evaluator-->>Route: SafetyEvaluationResult (clinicalFlag, guidance, isCritical)

    Route->>DB: prisma.healthObservation.create(...)
    DB-->>Route: Saved Record
    Route-->>Mobile: 201 Created { observation, safetyEvaluation }
    Mobile-->>User: Display Reading with Clinical Guidance Badge
```

