%% DIAGRAM 3: API & BACKEND INTERACTIONS (HISTORICAL TRENDS & CORRECTIONS)
%% -------------------------------------------------------------------------
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph ClientQueries ["Client API Requests"]
        Q_List["GET /api/observations?startDate=&endDate=&type=&limit="]
